@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>Novel Logger is a website designed and created by yours truly. I'm an avid reader, it's a hook that keeps catching me. I love reading and imagining all the action in the story.</p>
<p>I read so much that it's hard to keep track of the latest chapter, what was happening when I stopped, and chapters that make me feel nostalgic.</p>
<p>Thats what Novel Logger is for, it will track your latest chapters, allow you to note down what happened up until your entry, and hold entries so you don't lose chapters that you want to remember.</p>